* text=auto eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
# Parquet is binary and must round-trip byte for byte. `* text=auto` above
# leaves that to git's NUL-byte heuristic, which is fine until it is not — and
# data/btc_proxy_history_pre_ibit.parquet is hash-verified on every read as the
# anchor for every sleeve C Bitcoin value after 2024-01-11 (WS21). A line
# ending silently rewritten there would move S_c and restate the record.
*.parquet binary
